{
    "background_story": "Dearestone was a mysterious and ancient order of scholars dedicated to the preservation and study of forgotten knowledge. Their headquarters, hidden deep within a labyrinthine city, was a vast bibliotheca known as the 'Hall of the Quill'. This sacred repository contained tomes bound in a strange, otherworldly material that seemed to shift and glow in the dim light. Dearestone's members, sworn to secrecy, spent their lives uncovering and translating ancient texts, seeking to unlock the secrets of the universe. As the ages passed, their bibliotheca grew, attracting sages and seekers from far and wide. Dearestone's motto, 'Veritas in Tenebris' - Truth in the Shadows - reflected their quest to illuminate the darkness, one dusty page at a time.",
